# The Funnel door's Rita (openbq-rita-door in docker-compose.v6.yml). Copy to rita-door.env,
# chmod 600, never commit the filled copy. ONLY the Spark's OpenAI-compatible endpoint: no other
# provider key belongs here (compose blanks them anyway). With OPENAI_BASE_URL unset, "openai:"
# would mean OpenAI itself -- a paid model -- so it is required.
# OPENAI_BASE_URL: e.g. https://llm.<your-tailnet>.ts.net/v1
OPENAI_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_API_KEY: the Spark deployment accepts a non-secret placeholder.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# DEFAULT_MODEL: the model gateway-config's "ritaModel" names, e.g. openai:qwen3.6-35b
DEFAULT_MODEL=
